1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:07,174
Cudur aan calaamad lahayn… laakiin dhaawici kara wadnahaaga iyo maskaxdaada. Waayo dhiig-karka loogu yeeraa 'dilaaga aamusan'?

2
00:00:07,274 --> 00:00:14,927
Dhiig-karku waa marka dhiiggu si aad u xoog badan ugu riixo xididdada. Haddii cabbirkaagu yahay 140/90 ama ka badan, waa dhiig-kar.

3
00:00:15,027 --> 00:00:21,734
Inta badan wax calaamad ah ma dareemaysid. Adduunka oo dhan, 44% dadka qaba dhiig-karka ma oga inay qabaan.

4
00:00:21,834 --> 00:00:33,200
Daraasad lagu sameeyay Soomaali ku nool Minnesota, Maraykanka: 10-kii nin, ku dhawaad 3 ayaa qaba dhiig-kar. 10-kii haweenka, ku dhawaad 2. Khatartuna way sii kordhaysaa sannad kasta oo qurbaha lagu noolaado.

5
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:39,290
UK-ga, dadka Madow ee qaba dhiig-karka waxay 10% uga yar yihiin dadka kale inay dhiig-karkoodu xakameysan yahay.

6
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:43,885
Haddii aan la daaweyn, dhiig-karku wuxuu keeni karaa istaroog, wadne-xanuun, iyo kelyo dhaawacan.

7
00:00:43,985 --> 00:00:51,894
Tallaabada ugu horreysa: iska cabbir dhiig-karka, xitaa haddii aad caafimaad qabto. Milix yar cun, socod samee, oo qaado daawada haddii dhakhtarku kuu qoro.

8
00:00:51,994 --> 00:00:57,420
Talo caafimaad maaha, la tasho dhakhtarkaaga. Adiga, goorma ayaad ugu dambeysay inaad iska cabbirto?
